Subject: [PATCH] rv1103b clock reset support

Port the working RV1103B clock/reset driver and its CPU, split-fractional
divider and optional PVTPLL dependencies to OpenWrt Linux 6.12.112.
Keep the upstream clock framework and existing SoC backports.

Based on the working P44/Onion Linux 6.6 tree at 5f1c3d6cb.

